OL,3,A'Every day is difficult' says Ashley
OL,4,ADale's mum four years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said it was tough to see her other
OL,7,Ftwo daughters reaching milestones such
OL,8,Fas leaving school and celebrating
OL,9,Fproms, adding: "You want to be happy
OL,10,Fbut you're also really sad and the
OL,11,Fgirls are sad their big sister's not
OL,12,Fhere as well, to see their big
OL,13,Fmilestones in their lives as well."
